{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t亞殘運輪椅劍擊女子花劍團體賽，港隊決賽不敵國家隊，奪得銀牌。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n港隊由林嘉雯、鍾婉萍、余翠怡和湯雅婷組成。決賽大部分時間處於落後，國家隊於其中兩節連贏五劍，港隊最終以12:30落敗，奪得亞軍。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.581879+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T05:10:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T05:58:08.166817+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:13.101795+00:00","content_hash":"f90bbc8536466c351d2420d5eb4b256377d458361ed6ec25e012c8f6297729df","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}